{"ticker":{"symbol":"307950.KS","name":"현대오토에버","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":285500.0,"change_pct":0.010619469026548645,"market_cap":7829547122688.0,"pe":30.782255,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.006654991243432574,"week52_low":180700.0,"week52_high":1066000.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":5690,"website":"https://www.hyundai-autoever.com","business_summary":"Hyundai Autoever Corporation provides information and communication technology services in South Korea and internationally. The company offers vehicle IT services, such as mobility SW and SW development environment platforms, edge cloud computing, digital cockpit, and high definition map. It also provides DT services, including intelligent factory, mobility as a service, and enterprise IT solutions. In addition, it offers various core technologies consisting of cloud, big data, artificial intelligence, and cyber and vehicle securities. The company was formerly known as Autoever Systems Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Hyundai Autoever Corporation in January 2011. Hyundai Autoever Corporation was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"현대오토에버주식회사는 국내는 물론 해외에 정보통신기술 서비스를 제공하고 있습니다. 모빌리티 SW 및 SW 개발환경 플랫폼, 엣지 클라우드 컴퓨팅, 디지털 콕핏, 고화질 지도 등 차량 IT 서비스를 제공하고 있다. 또한 지능형 공장, 서비스형 모빌리티, 엔터프라이즈 IT 솔루션 등 DT 서비스도 제공합니다. 이 밖에도 클라우드, 빅데이터, 인공지능, 사이버·자동차 증권 등 다양한 핵심 기술을 제공하고 있다. 이 회사는 이전에 Autoever Systems Co., Ltd.로 알려졌으며 2011년 1월 현대 오토에버 주식회사로 사명을 변경했습니다. 현대 오토에버 주식회사는 2000년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":4883055110000.0,"rev_lo":4788000000000.0,"rev_hi":4951200000000.0,"rev_g":0.14840001,"n":11,"eps":7337.1816,"eps_lo":7006.0,"eps_hi":7861.0,"eps_g":0.1027},{"period":"2027","rev":5546214630000.0,"rev_lo":5178000000000.0,"rev_hi":5887700000000.0,"rev_g":0.1358,"n":13,"eps":9274.824,"eps_lo":8076.0,"eps_hi":10598.71,"eps_g":0.2641}